{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 01 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">CNN 主干：从大规模分类到现代卷积</span><span class=\"lang-en\">CNN Backbones</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_084_senet-title\">SENet</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">全局平均池化 squeeze 后经 bottleneck MLP 产生每通道 sigmoid 门，对卷积特征逐通道重标定。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Global average pooling (Squeeze) followed by a lightweight bottleneck MLP (Excitation) producing per-channel sigmoid gates.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">卷积 block 的多通道特征 X</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Multi-channel convolutional feature tensor X</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">输入自适应通道重标定后的特征或任务预测</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Input-adaptively channel-recalibrated feature tensor or classification output</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 1 · PDF p.2</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content_cvpr_2018/html/Hu_Squeeze-and-Excitation_Networks_CVPR_2018_paper.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_084_senet')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_084_senet')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"SENet original paper architecture figure, Figure 1\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/700c02d515d4c575125a.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 1 · PDF p.2</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 8 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_084_senet', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_084_senet\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_084_senet')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_084_senet', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_084_senet\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 08 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">特征 X</span><span class=\"lang-en\">feature X</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">任意主干 block 产生的 H×W×C 特征</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests multi-channel convolutional feature tensor x and prepares initial tensor representations (feature X).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"任意主干 block 产生的 H×W×C 特征\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests multi-channel convolutional feature tensor x and prepares initial tensor representations (feature X).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"特征 X\" data-node-name-en=\"feature X\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_084_senet', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">特征 X</span><span class=\"lang-en\">feature X</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">任意主干 block 产生的 H×W×C 特征</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests multi-channel convolutional feature tensor x and prepares initial tensor representations (feature X).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"ResNet/Inception 等原有卷积变换得到 U\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Stage 02 to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"主变换 F\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 02\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_084_senet', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">主变换 F</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 02</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">ResNet/Inception 等原有卷积变换得到 U</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Stage 02 to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"对 U 每通道做 global average pooling 得到 z∈R^C\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Squeeze within the core channel recalibration cnn computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"Squeeze\" data-node-name-en=\"Squeeze\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_084_senet', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Squeeze</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">对 U 每通道做 global average pooling 得到 z∈R^C</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Squeeze within the core channel recalibration cnn computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"W1 z 后 ReLU，按 reduction ratio 压缩通道描述\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs FC within the core channel recalibration cnn computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"FC 降维\" data-node-name-en=\"FC\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_084_senet', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">FC 降维</span><span class=\"lang-en\">FC</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">W1 z 后 ReLU，按 reduction ratio 压缩通道描述</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs FC within the core channel recalibration cnn computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"W2 恢复 C 维并输出 0–1 通道门 s\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs FC+Sigmoid within the core channel recalibration cnn computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"FC+Sigmoid\" data-node-name-en=\"FC+Sigmoid\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_084_senet', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>FC+Sigmoid</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">W2 恢复 C 维并输出 0–1 通道门 s</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs FC+Sigmoid within the core channel recalibration cnn computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"U_hat_c=s_c·U_c，对整张 feature map 逐通道重标定\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Channel Scaling within the core channel recalibration cnn computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"通道缩放\" data-node-name-en=\"Channel Scaling\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_084_senet', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">通道缩放</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Channel Scaling</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">U_hat_c=s_c·U_c，对整张 feature map 逐通道重标定</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Channel Scaling within the core channel recalibration cnn computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"在 SE-ResNet 中将 U_hat 与 shortcut 相加\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies residual to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"残差合并\" data-node-name-en=\"residual\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_084_senet', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">残差合并</span><span class=\"lang-en\">residual</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">在 SE-ResNet 中将 U_hat 与 shortcut 相加</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies residual to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"进入后续 stage 或分类/分割头\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces input-adaptively channel-recalibrated feature tensor or classification output via Task Output.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"任务输出\" data-node-name-en=\"Task Output\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_084_senet', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">任务输出</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Task Output</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">进入后续 stage 或分类/分割头</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces input-adaptively channel-recalibrated feature tensor or classification output via Task Output.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"SENet Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 通道 squeeze、excitation 与重标定</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Channel Squeeze, Excitation, and Adaptive Recalibration</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"SENet：核心公式 · 通道 squeeze、excitation 与重标定\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"84\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"30.064262pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.791958 -67.993583 247.502985 30.064262\" width=\"247.502985pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M6.233164 0V-.158807C5.588011-.228285 5.458981-.297763 5.458981-.575674C5.458981-.655078 5.468906-.734481 5.488757-.813884L6.798913-5.588011C6.967645-6.163686 7.047048-6.223238 7.612797-6.322492V-6.481299H5.161218V-6.322492C5.736893-6.253014 5.855998-6.173611 5.855998-5.895699C5.855998-5.746818 5.816296-5.54831 5.746818-5.280323L5.290249-3.652554H2.461504L2.997477-5.588011C3.146358-6.094208 3.404419-6.282791 3.999944-6.322492V-6.481299H1.290305V-6.322492C1.915606-6.26294 2.054562-6.183537 2.054562-5.895699C2.054562-5.746818 2.024786-5.54831 1.945382-5.280323L.724556-.893288C.545898-.317613 .47642-.258061-.079403-.158807V0H2.36225V-.158807C1.766725-.23821 1.657545-.307688 1.657545-.595525C1.657545-.665003 1.667471-.7444