.075465\"></use><use x=\"84.195974\" xlink:href=\"#m084_g20-50\" y=\"-49.581084\"></use><use x=\"88.46994\" xlink:href=\"#m084_g16-88\" y=\"-51.075465\"></use><use x=\"93.879639\" xlink:href=\"#m084_g10-185\" y=\"-51.075465\"></use><use x=\"97.336671\" xlink:href=\"#m084_g16-44\" y=\"-51.075465\"></use><use x=\"105.635552\" xlink:href=\"#m084_g20-49\" y=\"-49.581084\"></use><use x=\"110.009146\" xlink:href=\"#m084_g16-73\" y=\"-51.075465\"></use><use x=\"114.183489\" xlink:href=\"#m084_g10-186\" y=\"-51.075465\"></use><use x=\"117.999165\" xlink:href=\"#m084_g10-186\" y=\"-51.075465\"></use><use x=\"121.814841\" xlink:href=\"#m084_g16-150\" y=\"-51.075465\"></use><use x=\"137.12901\" xlink:href=\"#m084_g7-101\" y=\"-53.102866\"></use><use x=\"135.689424\" xlink:href=\"#m084_g16-42\" y=\"-51.075465\"></use><use x=\"143.027909\" xlink:href=\"#m084_g13-50\" y=\"-49.581084\"></use><use x=\"150.231533\" xlink:href=\"#m084_g4-61\" y=\"-51.075465\"></use><use x=\"159.59413\" xlink:href=\"#m084_g16-66\" y=\"-51.075465\"></use><use x=\"163.814312\" xlink:href=\"#m084_g13-50\" y=\"-49.581084\"></use><use x=\"167.901919\" xlink:href=\"#m084_g16-42\" y=\"-51.075465\"></use><use x=\"175.240404\" xlink:href=\"#m084_g13-50\" y=\"-49.581084\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">普通卷积隐式混合通道，缺少输入自适应的通道选择</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Standard convolutions fuse channels with fixed learned weights, lacking global content-aware channel selection.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">全局汇聚通道统计后用小型门控网络重标定各通道响应</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Squeeze global spatial statistics per channel and excite a small gating MLP to dynamically recalibrate channel responses.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">以极低开销显式建模通道依赖并可插入任意主干</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Models inter-channel dependencies explicitly at negligible parameter and compute overhead; plug-and-play across backbones.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">广泛用于器官分割、病灶分类和多模态通道融合</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Ubiquitous across medical organ segmentation, lesion classification, and multi-sequence MRI channel fusion.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">通道注意力经典模块；解释性有限，空间定位仍需其他机制</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Canonical channel-attention module; provides global channel weighting rather than spatial localization.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">global squeeze 把每通道的全图响应压缩为上下文描述，随后门控网络学习通道依赖。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">excitation 是输入自适应的软重标定，可插入多种主干而几乎不改变空间尺寸。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">SE 权重只说明模型的通道增益，不提供病灶空间定位，也不自动构成因果解释。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Squeeze global spatial statistics per channel and excite a small gating MLP to dynamically recalibrate channel responses.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Models inter-channel dependencies explicitly at negligible parameter and compute overhead; plug-and-play across backbones.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Channel Squeeze, Excitation, and Adaptive Recalibration.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">可用于器官分割、病灶分类和多模态 feature-channel 融合，计算开销低。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">小数据中门控可能追随扫描协议或设备通道偏差；解释时应结合空间证据和外部队列。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Ubiquitous across medical organ segmentation, lesion classification, and multi-sequence MRI channel fusion.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Canonical channel-attention module; provides global channel weighting rather than spatial localization.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content_cvpr_2018/html/Hu_Squeeze-and-Excitation_Networks_CVPR_2018_paper.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>Squeeze-and-Excitation Networks</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/hujie-frank/SENet\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}
